00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.400
with him closely on called Personal

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:24.320
Super Intelligence. And the whole idea

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:26.880
was like how do we make

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:29.359
AI how do we build powerful AI that

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.640
