00:00:36.719 --> 00:00:41.680
ideas and we basically alluded to I

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.239
think a lot of what muses ultimately

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:47.039
become, but we were gesturing at it like

00:00:44.239 --> 00:00:50.879
very very early like this was in you

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:53.120
know June 2025 um before really agents

00:00:50.879 --> 00:00:55.360
had happened in any meaningful way you

00:00:53.120 --> 00:00:57.280
know in the summer of 2025 like AI was

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.800
just you know in a totally different

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.399
