00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.600
pro training the model you have to build

00:01:22.159 --> 00:01:26.159
a whole stack for that. like is an it's

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:28.240
a very lengthy end to- end process. Um

00:01:26.159 --> 00:01:32.079
